<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Mechanism of Task-oriented Information Removal in In-context Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Visualization: the Direction of Information Reduction</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Mechanism of Task-oriented Information Removal in In-context Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Case Analysis for DHs’ Mechanism</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Mechanism of Task-oriented Information Removal in In-context Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>“Implicit Steering Heads” Discovered in §<span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Mechanism of Task-oriented Information Removal in In-context Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Augmentation Results</span></a>
