</section>
<section id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px5" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Accuracy with Instruction and Label Configuration in Fig. <a href="#S3.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ 3.2 LMs Intrinsically Recover TVS by Task-oriented Information Removal ‣ 3 Task-oriented Information Removal towards TVS ‣ Mechanism of Task-oriented Information Removal in In-context Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> and <a href="#S3.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ 3.2 LMs Intrinsically Recover TVS by Task-oriented Information Removal ‣ 3 Task-oriented Information Removal towards TVS ‣ Mechanism of Task-oriented Information Removal in In-context Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</h5>

<div id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report the test accuracies on the input configurations in Fig. <a href="#S3.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ 3.2 LMs Intrinsically Recover TVS by Task-oriented Information Removal ‣ 3 Task-oriented Information Removal towards TVS ‣ Mechanism of Task-oriented Information Removal in In-context Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> and <a href="#S3.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ 3.2 LMs Intrinsically Recover TVS by Task-oriented Information Removal ‣ 3 Task-oriented Information Removal towards TVS ‣ Mechanism of Task-oriented Information Removal in In-context Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> in Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ A.3 Details for Experiment of § ‣ Appendix A Experiment Details ‣ Mechanism of Task-oriented Information Removal in In-context Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px6" class="ltx_paragraph">
