<div id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We repeat the experiment shown in Fig. <a href="#S3.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ 3.2 LMs Intrinsically Recover TVS by Task-oriented Information Removal ‣ 3 Task-oriented Information Removal towards TVS ‣ Mechanism of Task-oriented Information Removal in In-context Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> on all the datasets and Llama 3.2-1B, Llama 3-8B, Qwen 2.5-3B in Fig. <a href="#A6.F47" title="Figure 47 ‣ Augmentation Results for Fig. and (“Factor-recall Filter Injection”). ‣ Appendix F Augmentation Results ‣ Mechanism of Task-oriented Information Removal in In-context Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">47</span></a> - <a href="#A6.F64" title="Figure 64 ‣ Augmentation Results for Fig. and (“Factor-recall Filter Injection”). ‣ Appendix F Augmentation Results ‣ Mechanism of Task-oriented Information Removal in In-context Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">64</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
