<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 24: </span>The cosine similarity between all the eigenvectors (each for a scatter) of <math id="A6.F24.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{\text{enc}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>enc</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{\text{enc}}</annotation></semantics></math> on specific layers and the subspace spanned by the top-64 principal components of the hidden state point cloud, measured by the ratio of vector norms before and after mapping to the principal subspace. On Llama 3.2-1B, SST-2, repeated on various inner ranks of TVS, i.e., the column dimensionality of <math id="A6.F24.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{\text{enc}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>enc</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{\text{enc}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure>
